{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03226","headline":"游法华寺 · 宋之问","name":"游法华寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄游京都日，遥羡稽山名。\n分刺江海郡，朅来徵素情。\n松露洗心眷，象筵敷念诚。\n薄云界青嶂，皎日骞朱甍。\n苔涧深不测，竹房闲且清。\n感真六象见，垂兆二𪅝鸣\n古今信灵迹，中州莫与京。\n林巘永栖业，岂伊佐一生。\n浮悟虽已久，事试去来成。\n观念幸相续，庶几最後明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}